    {
      "id": "01fe48af-a93d-30b0-8d87-3f7a07b354d1",
      "content": {
        "id": "01fe48af-a93d-30b0-8d87-3f7a07b354d1",
        "contentType": "STORY",
        "title": "Xiaomi (SEHK:1810) Stock Looks Reasonable On Earnings But Cheap On Cash Flow", // 职位
        "description": "",
        "summary": "Xiaomi stock has given investors a strong 3 year return, yet the current share price around HK$25.88 sits against an intrinsic value estimate from a Discounted Cash Flow (DCF) model that points to Xiaomi trading below that estimate, while traditional earnings based multiples suggest the shares are now closer to fair value. This split leaves investors weighing a DCF signal of potential undervaluation against a more neutral read from standard market ratios. Xiaomi has returned 128.6% over the...",
